+ <li>When a value set is bound to <a href="datatypes.html#string">string</a> or <a href="datatypes.html#uri">uri</a>, the literal instance value is matched to the concept code; the code system and display are not carried in the element value. Value sets bound to these datatypes should not include multiple concepts with the same code value from different code systems unless the binding context provides another way to disambiguate the system. See <a href="#extensible">Extensible Binding Strength</a> for extensibility rules.</li>
